  "description": "Hooke & MacDonald are delighted to bring this superb property to the market. 26 Saint Doolagh’s Square is a spacious three - bedroom mid terrace family home, extending to 109 sq.m / 1,173 sq.ft, situated in a popular development built by Shannon Homes.\n\nThe property offers bright, light filled accommodation throughout. The ground floor comprises of entrance hallway, a large living room to the front and a generous kitchen and dining area, fully equipped for all culinary needs to the rear of the property. The French doors from the kitchen provide direct access to the rear garden, ideal for entertaining and everyday living. This floor is completed with a utility area and w.c.\r\n\r\nOn the first floor, leading from the landing there are two spacious double bedrooms, one of\r\nwhich features an ensuite; there is also a single bedroom. There is a main bathroom and a hot press, for additional storage.\r\n\r\nSt Doolagh’s is conveniently located off the Malahide Road, within easy reach of a multitude of amenities, including shops, schools and parks, and the beautiful beaches of Portmarnock and Malahide. There are excellent transport links, with The DART and several bus links into the City Centre.",
